  "body": "- [x] Remove `backends/proc_ctp/` directory (CTP backend)\n- [x] Remove `backends/proc_crd/` directory (CRD backend)\n- [x] Remove `backends/proc_cert/` directory (shared CTP/CRD backend)\n- [x] Remove `backends/portfolio/templates/normative_rules.adoc.erb`\n- [x] Remove `spec/std/isa/proc_cert_model/` spec files\n- [x] Remove `spec/std/isa/proc_cert_class/` spec files (AC, MC, RVI; MockProcessor removed by PR #1739)\n- [x] Remove `spec/schemas/proc_cert_class_schema.json` and `proc_cert_model_schema.json`\n- [x] Remove `cert_normative_rules` from schemas and spec data\n- [x] Remove Ruby cert classes (`certificate.rb`, `certifiable_obj.rb`, `proc_cert_design.rb`, `cert_normative_rule.rb`)\n- [x] Modify `udb.rb`, `architecture.rb`, `portfolio_design.rb`, obj files\n- [x] Modify portfolio ERB templates, `Rakefile`, CI/CD workflows, docs\n- [x] Regenerate `regress.yml`\n- [x] Merged `origin/main` (resolved Xmock.yaml conflict — kept deleted, as also done by PR #1739)\n- [x] Bump udb gem version to 0.1.4; rename sorbet RBI file; update Gemfile.lock files\n- [x] Merged latest `origin/main` (resolved golden test `revdate` conflict)\n- [x] Merged latest `origin/main` (d7e5378, 22b20a3, b13341a — F extension impl, SCOUNTENABLE_EN, PMP_GRANULARITY fixes)\n- [x] Bump udb gem 0.1.7→0.1.8 and udb-gen 0.1.5→0.1.6 (prior merge); update Gemfile.lock files\n- [x] Merged latest `origin/main` (610531b noneOf fix, ba151af AGENTS.md); bump udb→0.1.9, udb-gen→0.1.7; rename sorbet RBI to udb@0.1.9.rbi\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n\n\n<!-- START COPILOT ORIGINAL PROMPT -->\n\n\n\n<details>\n\n<summary>Original prompt</summary>\n\n> Create a PR to remove all spec files related to CTPs and CRDs. Remove any tool support that is only used by CTP or CRDs. This should include entire Ruby classes in the udb gem. Remove associated schema files. Keep the portfolio class for now (there should only be child classes for profiles left). Remove backends that generate CTP and/or CRD documents. Remove CI/CD tests for those backends. Remove references to CTP and CRD from other backends, tools, and tests. Be sure you understand how regression test files are generated by \"bin/chore gen regress,\" as it will need to be run after removing CI tests. Remove CTP and CRD documents from the pages deployment and build workflows. Remove mention of CTP and/or CRD from any documentation. Monitor CI for the PR and fix any failures.\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT TIPS -->\n---\n\n✨ Let Copilot coding agent [set things up for you](https://github.com/riscv/riscv-unified-db/issues/new?title=✨+Set+up+Copilot+instructions&body=Configure%20instructions%20for%20this%20repository%20as%20documented%20in%20%5BBest%20practices%20for%20Copilot%20coding%20agent%20in%20your%20repository%5D%28https://gh.io/copilot-coding-agent-tips%29%2E%0A%0A%3COnboard%20this%20repo%3E&assignees=copilot) — coding agent works faster and does higher quality work when set up for your repo.\n",
